<blockquote class="uncited"><div>The CPS currently does not support lists of regions <br><br>You can however download data for 505 and then download data for anothe region, and the other region(s) will be appended<br><br>The subsequent presses on Download don't actually download again, it uses the cached download, but it still takes time to filter based on the region and append those DMR ID's to the master list that is compressed and uploaded to the radio when you press the Write button</div></blockquote>Thanks for the quick reply Roger, yeah that is what I had to go through, but can a Export be added to the CPS so that the current list that been compiled in the CPS downloaded so that not have to go through the whole process of going through all the regions you was in Contact ID list and then it can easily imported back into the CPS at later date. <br><br>When I went through all this last night I didn't know there was a firmware update for the RT3s so have not upgraded to the latest firmware as will have to go through region stuff again  <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_lol.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":lol:" title="Laughing"> <br><br>Regards &amp; 73<br>Dale de VK5ZSH<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=857">VK5FSCK</a> — Fri Nov 04, 2022 7:25 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
